{
  "job_B21.2.1.1.2_20251003_114536": {
    "chunk_text": "wostan, hu he missenlice on mon becume & hu his mon tilian scyle. Se hwosta h\u00e6f\u00f0 manigfealdne tocyme swa \u00fea spatl beo\u00f0 missenlicu, hwilum cym\u00f0 of Wyrc drenc wi\u00fe hwostan, genim mucgwyrt, seo\u00fe on cyperenum citele & wyl o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hio sie swi\u00fee Wi\u00fe hwostan eft genim hunan, seo\u00f0 on w\u00e6tere, sele swa wearme drincan. Eft genim clifwyrt, sume men hata\u00f0 foxes clife, sume eawyrt & hio sy geworht ofer midne sumor, Wi\u00f0 hwostan eft genim s\u00e6mintan, wyl on eala\u00fe, sele drincan. Eft genim spracen berindred, wyl on eala\u00f0, sele drincan. Eft genim hofan, gearwan, reade netelan, wyl on meolce. Eft genim wi\u00fe hwostan & wi\u00fe angbreoste slarian godne d\u00e6l, do bollan fulne wines to, bewyl Est genim marubian, wyl on eala\u00f0, do pipor on. Eft wi\u00fe angbreoste, gif men sie drige hwosta genim spices sn\u00e6de \u00feynne, lege on hatne stan, scead Wi\u00fe drigum hwostan eft genim eolonan & galluc, ete on huniges teare. Wi\u00fe breost w\u00e6rce genim \u00fea lytlan culmillan & cymed, wyl on hluttrum eala\u00fe, supe & drince. Eft genim dweorgedwostlan & gy\u00ferifan, kyncean, welle on hluttrum eala\u00f0, drince scenc fulne on Wyl on eala\u00f0 wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan, finul, marubian, betonican, & drince. Wi\u00fe breost",
